    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78603" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραπληρ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fill up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικαστήρια εἰς ἕνα καὶ διακοσίους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1629.206
				</span></i>
			(nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα[κλ]ηρῶσαι</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Gramm., <i>fill
			up</i>, of an expletive particle, Tryphoap.<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Conj.</u>
				247.25
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύνδεσμον παραπληροῦντα τὴν φάσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					300
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Geom., in 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραπληρωθεισῶν τῶν πλευρῶν</span>
			<i>being completed also</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mech.</u>
				848b28
			</span></i>.</div>
